# Copy to `.env` for local development. Never commit `.env` itself.
# Backend base URL (NestJS, global prefix /api, default port 8000 — see backend/src/main.ts).
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
# Optional: full Spline scene/embed URL for the home hero. When set, the hero
# shows the Spline embed; when unset, the built-in Three.js hero is used.
# VITE_SPLINE_URL=
